{"id":5441,"date":"2023-04-25T11:23:56","date_gmt":"2023-04-25T11:23:56","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/ritimus.co.uk\/?p=5441"},"modified":"2023-04-25T13:06:08","modified_gmt":"2023-04-25T13:06:08","slug":"dort-adimda-cocuklarimiza-sorumluluk-kazandirmak","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/ritimus.co.uk\/2023\/04\/25\/dort-adimda-cocuklarimiza-sorumluluk-kazandirmak\/","title":{"rendered":"D\u00f6rt Ad\u0131mda \u00c7ocuklar\u0131m\u0131za Sorumluluk Kazand\u0131rmak"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Her anne ve baba \u00e7ocuklar\u0131n\u0131n iyi ve ba\u015far\u0131l\u0131 bireyler olmas\u0131n\u0131 ister. Peki, bunu sa\u011flamak ad\u0131na ebeveynlere d\u00fc\u015fen g\u00f6revler nelerdir? Nas\u0131l bir yol haritas\u0131 izlemek gerek?&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>S\u00f6z gelimi odas\u0131n\u0131 derleme ve k\u0131yafetlerini toplama sorumlulu\u011funu kazand\u0131rmak istiyoruz. \u00d6ncelikle bu konu hakk\u0131nda \u00e7ocu\u011funuzla konu\u015fun ve <strong>bilgilendirme<\/strong> yap\u0131n. G\u00fczel dil, iyi at\u0131lm\u0131\u015f bir ad\u0131md\u0131r.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\" start=\"2\">\n<li>En az bir hafta ve en uzun bir ay olmak \u00fczere <strong>takip<\/strong> yap\u0131n. \u00c7ocu\u011funuzun sorumlulu\u011fu yerine getirip getirmedi\u011fini g\u00f6zlemleyin.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\" start=\"3\">\n<li>E\u011fer \u00e7ocu\u011funuz sorumlulu\u011funu yerine getirmiyorsa g\u00f6revi hakk\u0131nda yeniden bir bilgilendirme ve <strong>hat\u0131rlatma<\/strong> yap\u0131n.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\" start=\"4\">\n<li>\u00c7ocu\u011funuz sorumluluklar\u0131n\u0131 yerine getirmeye ba\u015flad\u0131ysa onu g\u00fczel s\u00f6zler ile motive edin. Ba\u015far\u0131 duygusunu ya\u015famaya ba\u015flayan \u00e7ocuk da bu motivasyonla sorumluluk bilincine sahip olmaya ba\u015flar.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Bu ad\u0131mlar ile ufak ve bilin\u00e7li dokunu\u015flar sayesinde \u00e7ocu\u011fumuzun hayat\u0131nda de\u011fi\u015fiklikler yapabiliriz. Daha fazlas\u0131 i\u00e7in RitimUS.co.uk ve sosyal medya hesaplar\u0131m\u0131zdan bizi takip edebilirsiniz.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Her anne ve baba \u00e7ocuklar\u0131n\u0131n iyi ve ba\u015far\u0131l\u0131 bireyler olmas\u0131n\u0131 ister. Peki, bunu sa\u011flamak ad\u0131na ebeveynlere d\u00fc\u015fen g\u00f6revler nelerdir? Nas\u0131l bir yol haritas\u0131 izlemek gerek? <\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":3,"featured_media":5442,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"spay_email":"","footnotes":"","jetpack_publicize_message":"","jetpack_is_tweetstorm":false,"jetpack_publicize_feature_enabled":true},"categories":[1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-5441","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-uncategorized"],"jetpack_featured_media_url":"https:\/\/ritimus.co.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/Dort-Adimda-Cocuklarimiza-Sorumluluk-Kazandirmak.jpg","_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/ritimus.co.uk\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5441","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/ritimus.co.uk\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/ritimus.co.uk\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/ritimus.co.uk\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/3"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/ritimus.co.uk\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=5441"}],"version-history":[{"count":2,"href":"https:\/\/ritimus.co.uk\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5441\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":5482,"href":"https:\/\/ritimus.co.uk\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5441\/revisions\/5482"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/ritimus.co.uk\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/5442"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/ritimus.c